/span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.Test.advance","kind":"def","line":586,"name":"MC4000.Test.advance","sourceLink":"https://github.com/a2435191/shenzhen-lean/blob/48728217f18fc01d439991efb2b77ce532d5d756/Shenzhen/MC4000.lean#L586-L587"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.Test.board\"><span class=\"name\">MC4000</span>.<span class=\"name\">Test</span>.<span class=\"name\">board</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#Board\">Board</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.Test.board","kind":"def","line":567,"name":"MC4000.Test.board","sourceLink":"https://github.com/a2435191/shenzhen-lean/blob/48728217f18fc01d439991efb2b77ce532d5d756/Shenzhen/MC4000.lean#L567-L584"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.advanceTimeUnit\"><span class=\"name\">MC4000</span>.<span class=\"name\">advanceTimeUnit</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">ℕ</a>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">board</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#Board\">Board</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">states</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Vector/Basic.html#Vector\">Vector</a> <a href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.State\">State</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">fuel</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">ℕ</a> := <a href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.advanceTimeUnit.defaultMaxFuel\">advanceTimeUnit.defaultMaxFuel</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Vector/Basic.html#Vector\">Vector</a> <a href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.State\">State</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Advance one time unit across many interconnected chips. This can only happen\nif every chip is in the `IOEffects.sleep` state (or empty, with no instructions TODO check this).\n\nUntil all chips are empty, we call `advanceTick`.\nSometimes chips *never* sleep, so `fuel` serves as an upper bound on the number of iterations.\nThis function returns success, i.e. whether we returned before `fuel` hit zero.\n\nIf successful, the instruction pointer of any chips that have finished sleeping (remember\nthat chips can sleep for multiple time units) is incremented (or set in the case of a `.jmp`).\n ","docLink":"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.advanceTimeUnit","kind":"def","line":537,"name":"MC4000.advanceTimeUnit","sourceLink":"https://github.com/a2435191/shenzhen-lean/blob/48728217f18fc01d439991efb2b77ce532d5d756/Shenzhen/MC4000.lean#L537-L563"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.advanceTimeUnit.defaultMaxFuel\"><span class=\"name\">MC4000</span>.<span class=\"name\">advanceTimeUnit</span>.<span class=\"name\">defaultMaxFuel</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">ℕ</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.advanceTimeUnit.defaultMaxFuel","kind":"def","line":535,"name":"MC4000.advanceTimeUnit.defaultMaxFuel","sourceLink":"https://github.com/a2435191/shenzhen-lean/blob/48728217f18fc01d439991efb2b77ce532d5d756/Shenzhen/MC4000.lean#L535-L535"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.advanceTick.step\"><span class=\"name\">MC4000</span>.<span class=\"name\">advanceTick</span>.<span class=\"name\">step</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">ℕ</a>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">board</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#Board\">Board</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">states</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Vector/Basic.html#Vector\">Vector</a> <a href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.State\">State</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Vector/Basic.html#Vector\">Vector</a> <a href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.State\">State</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span> → <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">alreadyTicked</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Vector/Basic.html#Vector\">Vector</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>) → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Vector/Basic.html#Vector\">Vector</a> <a href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.State\">State</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Vector/Basic.html#Vector\">Vector</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"One step within processing a tick. For every state that hasn't already been ticked, update\nit according to the outermost constructor, i.e. try to resolve simple I/O and XBus as far as possible\nuntil getting blocked by XBus or reaching `.sleep` or `.pure`. ","docLink":"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.advanceTick.step","kind":"def","line":517,"name":"MC4000.advanceTick.step","sourceLink":"https://github.com/a2435191/shenzhen-lean/blob/48728217f18fc01d439991efb2b77ce532d5d756/Shenzhen/MC4000.lean#L517-L529"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.advanceTick.stepUntilDone\"><span class=\"name\">MC4000</span>.<span class=\"name\">advanceTick</span>.<span class=\"name\">stepUntilDone</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">ℕ</a>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">board</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#Board\">Board</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">states</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Vector/Basic.html#Vector\">Vector</a> <a href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.State\">State</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Vector/Basic.html#Vector\">Vector</a> <a href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.State\">State</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span> → <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">alreadyTicked</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Vector/Basic.html#Vector\">Vector</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>) → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Vector/Basic.html#Vector\">Vector</a> <a href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.State\">State</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Keep applying `step` until no further progress can be made, in which case\nwe're ready to end the tick. ","docLink":"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.advanceTick.stepUntilDone","kind":"def","line":495,"name":"MC4000.advanceTick.stepUntilDone","sourceLink":"https://github.com/a2435191/shenzhen-lean/blob/48728217f18fc01d439991efb2b77ce532d5d756/Shenzhen/MC4000.lean#L495-L500"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.advanceTick.originalSimpleIOOuts\"><span class=\"name\">MC4000</span>.<span class=\"name\">advanceTick</span>.<span class=\"name\">originalSimpleIOOuts</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">ℕ</a>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">states</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Vector/Basic.html#Vector\">Vector</a> <a href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.State\">State</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Vector/Basic.html#Vector\">Vector</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Data/Vector/Basic.html#Vector\">Vector</a> <a href=\"./Shenzhen/SimpleIOData.html#SimpleIOData\">SimpleIOData</a> <a href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.numSimpleIOPins\">numSimpleIOPins</a>)</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.advanceTick.originalSimpleIOOuts","kind":"def","line":490,"name":"MC4000.advanceTick.originalSimpleIOOuts","sourceLink":"https://github.com/a2435191/shenzhen-lean/blob/48728217f18fc01d439991efb2b77ce532d5d756/Shenzhen/MC4000.lean#L490-L491"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.advanceTick\"><span class=\"name\">MC4000</span>.<span class=\"name\">advanceTick</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">ℕ</a>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">board</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#Board\">Board</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">states</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Vector/Basic.html#Vector\">Vector</a> <a href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.State\">State</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Vector/Basic.html#Vector\">Vector</a> <a href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.State\">State</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Advance one CPU cycle across many interconnected chips.\n\nA simple I/O read will use the previous `simpleIOOuts`s; it does not see new data from connected chips writing\nin the same tick. (TODO confirm this)\n\nIncrement the instruction pointer for each chip whose instruction has finished completely (i.e. ending in a `IOEffects.pure` state).\nThen use `instructionEffects` to compute (and set) the `IOEffects` of the new instruction on the pure state.\n\nThe effect of running this function `n` times for large `n` should be to get all chips\nstuck waiting for XBus I/O to/from other chips, done with the current instruction and moved on to\nthe next (i.e. `.pure`), or sleeping for a time. ","docLink":"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.advanceTick","kind":"def","line":444,"name":"MC4000.advanceTick","sourceLink":"https://github.com/a24