=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Vector/Basic.html#Vector\">Vector</a> <a href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.State\">State</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Resolve all outermost `IOEffects.simpleIORead`s by reading the max of connected chips' `simpleIOOut` fields and setting `simpleIOOut`\nto zero wherever a read occurs. Note that this uses `originalSimpleIOOuts`, i.e. those\nfrom the start of the tick before any simple I/O reads or writes occurred. This function\nalso ignores wherever `alreadyTicked[i] = true`. ","docLink":"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.resolveSimpleIOReads","kind":"def","line":375,"name":"MC4000.resolveSimpleIOReads","sourceLink":"https://github.com/a2435191/shenzhen-lean/blob/48728217f18fc01d439991efb2b77ce532d5d756/Shenzhen/MC4000.lean#L375-L393"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.resolveSimpleIOWrites\"><span class=\"name\">MC4000</span>.<span class=\"name\">resolveSimpleIOWrites</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">ℕ</a>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">states</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Vector/Basic.html#Vector\">Vector</a> <a href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.State\">State</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">alreadyTicked</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Vector/Basic.html#Vector\">Vector</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=