e.html#Nat\">ℕ</a>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">xBusConns</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Shenzhen/Conns.html#Conns\">Conns</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <a href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.XBus\">XBus</a></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">whichPin</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Fin\">Fin</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.XBus\">XBus</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">states</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Vector/Basic.html#Vector\">Vector</a> <a href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.State\">State</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">alreadyTicked</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Vector/Basic.html#Vector\">Vector</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <span class=\"fn\">((<span class=\"fn\">j</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Fin\">Fin</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>) × <a href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.XBus\">XBus</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Shenzhen/Integer.html#Integer\">Integer</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Shenzhen/IOEffects.html#IOEffects\">IOEffects</a> <a href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.XBus\">XBus</a> <a href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.SimpleIO\">SimpleIO</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.InstructionState\">InstructionState</a> <span class=\