numXBusPins\">numXBusPins</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"See the documentation comments in `MC4000.lean`. This represents whether each\nXBus pin is ready to write. This may change between CPU cycles inside an instruction because\nXBus writes set it and XBus reads clear it. ","docLink":"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.State.waitingToWrite","kind":"def","line":257,"name":"MC4000.State.waitingToWrite","sourceLink":"https://github.com/a2435191/shenzhen-lean/blob/48728217f18fc01d439991efb2b77ce532d5d756/Shenzhen/MC4000.lean#L257-L257"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.State.simpleIOOut\"><span class=\"name\">MC4000</span>.<span class=\"name\">State</span>.<span class=\"name\">simpleIOOut</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.State\">State</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Vector/Basic.html#Vector\">Vector</a> <a href=\"./Shenzhen/SimpleIOData.html#SimpleIOData\">SimpleIOData</a> <a href=\"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.numSimpleIOPins\">numSimpleIOPins</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The values being written out of each simple I/O pin. Reading\nfrom a pin sets this value to 0 (but the read value is just the max of all the other writers on this wire).\nSee `resolveSimpleIO...` below.\n\nThis may change from one CPU cycle to another within an instruction.\nFor example, this occurs in the instruction `mov p0 x0` if the chip was writing something\nout of `p0` before this instruction. ","docLink":"./Shenzhen/MC4000.html#MC4000.State.simpleIOOut","kind":"def","line":251,"name":"MC4000.State.simpleIOOut","sourceLink":"https://github.com/a2435191/shenzhen-lean/blob/48728217f18fc01d439991efb2b77ce532d5d756/Shenzhen/MC4000.lean#L251-L251"}},{"header":"